[32m+[m[32m## Overview[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**NAGARLENS** is an infrastructure intelligence platform designed to build a persistent, evidence-backed digital memory of physical urban infrastructure. By combining edge-capable mobile data collection, spatial analysis, and computer vision, NAGARLENS captures the life cycle of civil assets—tracking their physical condition, localized changes, maintenance interventions, and long-term outcomes over time.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mUrban drainage networks are frequently subject to silent degradation, unrecorded blockages, and recurring waterlogging. NAGARLENS transforms reactive municipal maintenance into a verifiable, audit-ready asset memory system.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Key Capabilities[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Field Evidence Capture:** High-integrity mobile photo/video observation capture with embedded spatial context (GPS/altitude/bearing) and offline sync resilience.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **AI-Powered Visual Intelligence:** Custom computer vision pipeline for automated defect detection (e.g., drain clogging, structural cracking, sediment accumulation, trash accumulation) and severity scoring.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Spatial Asset Registry:** PostGIS-powered geospatial modeling of drainage lines, manholes, catch basins, and flood-prone zones.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Timeline & Memory Graph:** Immutably tracked historical state of assets over time, providing verifiable proof of condition before and after maintenance interventions.[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Human-in-the-Loop Verification:** Workflow tools for municipal engineers to review, confirm, or override AI-generated assessments before work order generation.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
