[32m+[m[32m- **Networking:** Retrofit + OkHttp with resilience & sync adapters[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Concurrency:** Kotlin Coroutines & Flow[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### Backend Services[m
