[32m+[m[32m### AI Vision Engine[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Language/Framework:** Python, PyTorch / ONNX Runtime[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Capabilities:** Semantic segmentation, object detection, image hashing, EXIF validation, and privacy masking (blurring faces/license plates).[m
